  "details": "The URL links in profiles automatically set icons for specific web services. \n\nHowever, it seems that the conditions for setting the icon don't match between the web page and the client.\n\nHere are the differences:\n\nx.com:\n\nWeb: Available\n\nClient: Unavailable\n\ntwitter.com:\n\nWeb & Client: Available\n\ntwitch.tv:\n\nWeb & Client: Available\n\nbooth.pm:\n\nWeb: Unavailable\n\nClient: Available",
